# Role Color Identity

One IntelliROI chassis. **Role accents change — fonts/surfaces do not.**

## Chassis (always)

- Fonts: Inter + JetBrains Mono
- Surfaces: `ink` `#09090B` · `surface` · `hairline`
- Sharp corners ≈ 0 · Lucide 1.5 · ease `[0.22,1,0.36,1]`
- Logo / `INTELLIROI` wordmark → always brand mint `#00E5A8`

## Role accents

| Role | `data-role-theme` | Accent |
|------|-------------------|--------|
| Super Admin | `super-admin` | `#67E8F9` ice cyan |
| CEO | `ceo` | `#E8C547` executive gold |
| Dept Manager | `department-manager` | `#4F8CFF` signal blue |
| Team Lead | `team-lead` | `#2DD4BF` aurora teal |
| Employee | `employee` | `#00E5A8` brand mint |

Wire via CSS `--role-accent` / `--role-glow` on AppShell. Do not fork separate themes.

## Paint with role accent

Active nav · primary CTA · focus ring · live pulse · KPI spark / primary series · role badge

## Never role-swap

Backgrounds · body text · logo · `warning`/`danger` semantics · purple/indigo accents

Full spec: `.cursor/docs/ROLE_COLOR_IDENTITY.md`
